# Plex's one-time claim token, for a new server's first start only. Copy to plex.env and restrict it
# (cp plex.env.example plex.env && chmod 600 plex.env); plex.env is gitignored and never committed.
#
# Get a token at https://www.plex.tv/claim/ just before `docker compose up`: it expires within minutes. Once the
# server shows up in your Plex account, empty the value again. An existing (adopted or restored) server is already
# claimed and doesn't need it.
PLEX_CLAIM=
